  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "每一步的持久化边界",
      "items": [
        "accept、generation intent、tool intent 都先写意图再执行副作用；publishResponse 与 placement 才写最终 entry。",
        "帧与工具 checkpoint 进 pi.pending.*，不进 transcript；重启后由 effect_pending 恢复。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "图外的分支",
      "items": [
        "模型 error 可能进入 retry_wait；deferred 响应进入 suspended，需显式 poll permit。",
        "取消是 cancel_requested 标记 + reconcile，不是 signal；unsafe 工具不重放。"
      ]
    }
